{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2022-05-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'WALMART TO PARTICIPATE IN THE BAIRD 2022 GLOBAL CONSUMER, TECHNOLOGY & SERVICES CONFERENCE', 'text': "BENTONVILLE, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WALMART INC. (NYSE: WMT) ANNOUNCED TODAY, JUDITH MCKENNA, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WALMART INTERNATIONAL, WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE BAIRD 2022 GLOBAL CONSUMER, TECHNOLOGY & SERVICES CONFERENCE TUESDAY, JUNE 7, AT 10:15 A.M. EDT. THE SESSION WILL BE WEBCAST LIVE THROUGH THE “EVENTS” LINK AT WWW.STOCK.WALMART.COM. A TRANSCRIPT OF THE SESSION WILL BE AVAILABLE AFTER THE EVENT AND WILL BE ARCHIVED ON THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE. ABOUT WALMART WALMART IN"}